                  "x",
                  [
                     "Add",
                     "x",
                     2
                  ]
               ],
               "x"
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The first term is 1/(x + 2) = (x + 2)/(x + 2)^2, so s'(x) = (x + 2 + 2 ln(x))/(x + 2)^2.",
